icked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df781876-ce61-4e6c-9c00-4aedc89a01ad)\r\n-->\r\nImplements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6653\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3cc31723-b547-40d4-9813-590b2f817dea)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe proposal already had a linked PR which added color buttons to the gutter. \r\nThis PR instead adds color buttons directly in the text area, and supports multiple colors per line, like in VSCode. Had to make some `text_server_adv` fixes to support objects with 0 span length.\r\n\r\nThe following constructors are supported:\r\n- `Color()` (Empty, an html color string, or 3-4 rgba values)\r\n- `Color.from_hsv()`\r\n- `Color.from_rgba8()`\r\n- `Color.from_ok_hsl`\r\n\r\nThe mode / format of the constructor will match which mode is selected in the color picker. Video demo:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d9fec3c-d881-448c-8d79-aee22bae64b4\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","ur